# AI Project Workbook (RAG, Extraction, Agents, MCP, Fine-tuning)

Save this file. Open it at the start of every new project.

---

## PART 1: What kind of project is this?

Ask these questions in order. Stop at the first "yes".

| # | Question | If YES, use this pattern |
|---|----------|--------------------------|
| 1 | Can the whole document fit inside one prompt? (a few pages) | **No RAG.** Paste the text into the prompt. Done. |
| 2 | Do I need specific fields out of a document (name, date, amount)? | **Extraction** (Pattern 2 below). Also no RAG. |
| 3 | Are the answers inside a big pile of documents that will not fit in one prompt? | **RAG** (Pattern 1 below) |
| 4 | Must the AI choose between several actions (search, calculate, call an API)? | **Agent + tools** (Pattern 3 below) |
| 5 | Do I want many different AI apps to use my tools in a standard way? | **MCP** (Part 4) |
| 6 | Do I need the model to change its style or behaviour, not just know more facts? | **Fine-tuning** (Part 5) |

Simple rule:
- Need the model to KNOW more facts? Use RAG.
- Need the model to BEHAVE differently? Use fine-tuning.
- Need the model to DO things? Use an agent with tools.

